# 004 · Scan the history for secrets

**Status:** `READY` · **Version:** [v0.1.0](../roadmap.md#v010) · **Part:** Tester basics

## What

Run a secret scanner (gitleaks) over every branch that will be published, and add the scan to CI. Allowlist the fake, key-shaped values that the tests use.

## Why

The history was reviewed with a denylist and a term scan before it was published. No secret scanner has run on it yet.

## Done when

- [ ] A scan of every published branch finds only allowlisted test values.
- [ ] CI runs the scan on every push.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

## Progress

- 2026-10-19: Goal written from the v0.1.0 release plan.

